MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 78c39ca0aa3b4c60ad7cb11e9f4cf262, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialTopic_Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Features.Tutorial.Data.TutorialTopicData
  <Title>k__BackingField: Intro
  <Chapters>k__BackingField:
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Welcome!
    <Description>k__BackingField: Thanks for playing Medieval Merchant! Your goal
      is to build a profitable trade network by buying and selling goods between
      towns and helping them grow over time.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c709834b8c40f154eadafcdd233b5c4f, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Trading
    <Description>k__BackingField: You can buy goods that towns produce and sell them
      to other towns. You find your inventory on the left and the towns inventory
      and production buildings on the right of the screen.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: eb9eea30894c9254d857dacffb175916, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Prices
    <Description>k__BackingField: 'Prices are driven by supply and demand as well
      as a variety of other factors. Make sure to pay attention to current events
      in the game.

      If you want to understand how prices are calculated, you
      can hover them in the trade popup.'
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: a39e4c0426eec1749935fa45e400c061, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Towns
    <Description>k__BackingField: Each town produces certain goods based on the resources
      of nearby regions. Supplying towns with what they lack helps them grow, unlock
      better production bulidings and trade opportunities.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: f98f770fb6e4dec4482fbe90558c34d0, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Caravan
    <Description>k__BackingField: Carts determine how much you can carry and how
      fast you travel. The better your carts, the more you can carry but the higher
      is also your upkeep.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 26b50d3182430fc4f87ed42291e0ffca, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Winning and Losing
    <Description>k__BackingField: To win you need to satisfy all win conditions and
      manage to not trigger any losing condition.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 843a113f39c8d1c4ab58c8014f647e47, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Tutorials
    <Description>k__BackingField: If you ever wonder how things work, look out for
      buttons with question marks. They open further tutorials.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 0029403eeb99b3c489e93f522ae8d402, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Good Luck!
    <Description>k__BackingField: 'That is all for now :)

      You will learn more
      as you play. Enjoy the journey!'
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: f3fd06d3747dcc54890b0bcdbfd25640, type: 3}
